{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00178",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.8,
      "end_seconds": 3.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Good morning. Come in, have a seat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.55,
      "end_seconds": 7.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Oh, thanks. Sorry, I'm a little early."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 8.34,
      "end_seconds": 13.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Uh, uh, thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.74,
      "end_seconds": 16.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Right, weather's turned, hasn't it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.43,
      "end_seconds": 25.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "Um, um, it has. I got caught in the rain walking over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.46,
      "end_seconds": 28.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Okay, in your own words, what's happened?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 30.12,
      "end_seconds": 38.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.98,
      "text": "Okay, so it's been losing weight without trying, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.19,
      "end_seconds": 40.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.52,
      "end_seconds": 48.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "I mean, um, about... well, two months. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.7,
      "end_seconds": 53.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Okay, anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.78,
      "end_seconds": 63.98,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a low fever in the evenings as well. The low fever in the evenings? That's been for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.81,
      "end_seconds": 67.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Right, any loss of appetite as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.6,
      "end_seconds": 71.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Yes, uh, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.35,
      "end_seconds": 73.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Has there been a cough too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.3,
      "end_seconds": 77.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Yes, um, about the same, two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.49,
      "end_seconds": 81.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.68,
      "end_seconds": 87.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Um, I'd give it a three, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.68,
      "end_seconds": 93.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Any shortness of breath, coughing up blood, chest pain or lumps in the neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.1,
      "end_seconds": 97.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Um, no, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.82,
      "end_seconds": 101.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.94,
      "end_seconds": 103.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.86,
      "end_seconds": 117.57,
      "duration_seconds": 13.71,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.4,
      "end_seconds": 122.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Right, good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.77,
      "end_seconds": 125.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Right, do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.37,
      "end_seconds": 128.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.15,
      "end_seconds": 134.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.68,
      "end_seconds": 135.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.38,
      "end_seconds": 138.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.41,
      "end_seconds": 140.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.26,
      "end_seconds": 161.65,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.08,
      "end_seconds": 168.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "I've had diabetes, yes. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.3,
      "end_seconds": 170.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.71,
      "end_seconds": 180.62,
      "duration_seconds": 9.91,
      "text": "Uh, I've got heart disease. I took the morning off to come in today. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.09,
      "end_seconds": 182.06,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.4,
      "end_seconds": 190.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "Okay, heart disease, that's already on your record. Good to know. What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.23,
      "end_seconds": 196.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "It's Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 197.35,
      "end_seconds": 204.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the Glycomet was 250 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.77,
      "end_seconds": 210.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.47,
      "end_seconds": 216.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. It's aspirin, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.08,
      "end_seconds": 219.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Okay, how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.65,
      "end_seconds": 223.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "75 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.47,
      "end_seconds": 226.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.85,
      "end_seconds": 229.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 230.19,
      "end_seconds": 239.47,
      "duration_seconds": 9.28,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pulse 94, pressure 104 over 76, respiratory rate 16. Temperature is 38.8 degrees, oxygen saturation is 95 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.72,
      "end_seconds": 245.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Thanks. Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.0,
      "end_seconds": 250.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Yeah, I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.71,
      "end_seconds": 254.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.42,
      "end_seconds": 257.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Tell me if anything hurts as I press."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.66,
      "end_seconds": 275.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Air entry is a bit reduced at the top of the right lung."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.37,
      "end_seconds": 279.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Tell me if anything hurts as I press."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.56,
      "end_seconds": 294.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "I can feel a couple of small glands in your neck, not tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.97,
      "end_seconds": 325.66,
      "duration_seconds": 27.69,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is an infection or something chronic going on, I can't say what yet. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. A thyroid problem is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.33,
      "end_seconds": 329.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Well, doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.43,
      "end_seconds": 349.21,
      "duration_seconds": 18.78,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's an infection or something chronic going on, I can't say what yet, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been losing weight without trying for two months, and no chest pain or coughing up blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.89,
      "end_seconds": 352.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.06,
      "end_seconds": 356.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.34,
      "end_seconds": 358.04,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.18,
      "end_seconds": 389.95,
      "duration_seconds": 22.77,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. I'm going to order blood tests, for weight loss. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'm going to order a chest X-ray, for weight loss and cough. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. We should do a sputum test for chronic cough. Weigh yourself once a week at the same time and note it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.9,
      "end_seconds": 412.33,
      "duration_seconds": 21.43,
      "text": "Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 413.05,
      "end_seconds": 414.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 415.32,
      "end_seconds": 422.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.2,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if you cough up blood or get breathless. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 423.22,
      "end_seconds": 424.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 425.53,
      "end_seconds": 427.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Come back in a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 428.65,
      "end_seconds": 429.35,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 430.06,
      "end_seconds": 434.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 435.42,
      "end_seconds": 440.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "So, you know, I come back in a week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 441.86,
      "end_seconds": 447.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "Right, yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 448.41,
      "end_seconds": 450.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 451.5,
      "end_seconds": 453.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}